        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D0806LA-MS, Max Steel Low Profile Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's low profile modern style single cylinder deadbolt kit has many features which ensure a product of high security. The exterior collars are made of solid forged brass with a very low 3/8\" projection off the door. The 1\" deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforced strike plate with 3\" long screws for additional security.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia Max-Steel finish will change the way you think about stainless steel. The unique process in the manufacturing provides a superior resistance to tarnishing and pitting. Max Steel is a PVD <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> coating that is highly resistant to extreme elements. It has a lifetime <b>No Tarnish Guarantee</b>. Recommended for harsh environments such as salty air.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe interiors have large contemporary turnpieces which are both aesthetically pleasing and easy to operate.  Fits 1-3/4\" thick doors with standard 2-1/8\" door prep. Deadbolt kit includes lock cylinder with collar, deadbolt assembly, faceplate and strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D0806LA-MS Low Profile Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Available with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>For <b>1-3/4\" Thick Doors</b></li>\r\n<li>Max Steel <b>PVD Satin Stainless Steel Finish</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n<b>This item  discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/omnia-deadbolts-and-privacy-bolts\">Omnia Deadbolts</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
